  "bodyHash": "43382f3073f084a5",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。倾注爱意打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">下界传送门会将（下界）方块扩散到以传送门为中心、半径 configurable 范围内的主世界区域。默认情况下，你可以在传送门半径内放置四个煤块来阻止扩散。但这可以在配置文件中更改。当扩散效果开始或被阻止时，传送门周围的玩家会收到一条消息。<br><br>模组将所有传送门的位置保存到 '<em>../world-folder/data/netherportalspread/portals/</em>'。当传送门被创建或玩家从下界回到主世界时，会检测到新传送门。因此，对于旧的世界，你需要穿过传送门再回来一次以启动扩散效果，或者重新激活传送门。这比检查世界中每个方块是否存在传送门要高效得多。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"color:#008000\">版本 4.4 及以上兼容沉浸式传送门（Immersive Portals）模组。</span></em></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含在 The Vanilla Experience 中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含在 Serilum&#x27;s RPG Bundle 中\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnPortalCreation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，向传送门周围的玩家发送消息，告知下界正在扩散，并且你可以使用 'preventSpreadBlockString' 方块的 'preventSpreadBlockAmountNeeded' 数量来阻止扩散。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>messageOnPortalCreation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 \"<em>你感觉到一股来自传送门的腐败能量。除非在传送门周围 %portalSpreadRadius% 个方块的半径内放置 %preventSpreadBlockAmountNeeded% 个 %preventSpreadBlockString%，否则下界将缓慢扩散到主世界。</em>\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">创建传送门时发送的消息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnPreventSpreadBlocksFound</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，当传送门检测到新的 'preventSpreadBlockString' 方块时，向传送门周围的玩家发送消息，告知下界扩散已停止。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>messageOnPreventSpreadBlocksFound</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 \"<em>放置了足够的 %preventSpreadBlockString% 后，你感觉到腐败的能量逐渐消退。</em>\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">找到阻止扩散方块时发送的消息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendMessageOnPortalBroken</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，当传送门被破坏时，向玩家发送消息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>messageOnPortalBroken</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 \"<em>随着下界传送门的破坏，腐败能量不再能够进入主世界。</em>\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">传送门被破坏时发送的消息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>prefixPortalCoordsInMessage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，在传送门消息中显示传送门坐标。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>portalSpreadRadius</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 15, 最小 1, 最大 100</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">下界方块可以扩散的传送门周围半径。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>spreadDelayTicks&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 40, 最小 1, 最大 72000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;下界传送门周围扩散之间的延迟（以刻为单位）。20 刻 = 1 秒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>instantConvertAmount</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 50, 最小 0, 最大 1000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">检测到传送门时，瞬间转换为下界方块的方块数量。如果半径内已有现有的下界方块，其数量将从此数字中扣除。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventSpreadWithBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，当半径内有 n（定义）个阻止扩散方块（定义）时，阻止扩散效果。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventSpreadBlockAmountNeeded</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 4</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在下界传送门半径内需要放置的阻止扩散方块（定义）的数量，以防止扩散。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventSpreadBlockString</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 \"<em>minecraft:coal_block</em>\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">防止下界传送门扩散的方块。默认为煤块（minecraft:coal_block 是命名空间 ID）。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>默认情况下，模组会在以下情况向传送门周围的玩家发送消息：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>传送门被创建，扩散开始：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"533\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用阻止扩散方块（在配置中定义）停止传送门扩散：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"533\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>传送门被破坏时的消息：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"533\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可配置的扩散方块</strong></span><br>你可以在位于 \"<strong>./config/netherportalspread/</strong>\" 的 \"<strong>spreadsettings.txt</strong>\" 文件中定义哪些方块应扩散为什么方块以及发生的几率。默认情况下，它包含以下内容：<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>stone; [netherrack&gt;10 + magma_block&gt;2 + nether_quartz_ore&gt;1],</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>grass_block; [netherrack&gt;1],</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>dirt; [netherrack&gt;1],</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>sand; [soul_sand&gt;1],</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>gravel; [soul_sand&gt;1],</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>stone_bricks; [nether_bricks&gt;2 + red_nether_bricks&gt;1],<br>sea_lantern; [glowstone&gt;1],<br>farmland; [soul_sand&gt;1],<br>wheat; [nether_wart&gt;1]</em></span></p>\n<p><br><strong>如果名称值中不包含 \":\"（冒号），模组会自动在名称前添加 \"minecraft:\"。</strong><br><strong>格式为：</strong> FROMBLOCK; [TOBLOCK&gt;WEIGHT (+ TOBLOCK&gt;WEIGHT + TOBLOCK&gt;WEIGHT) ]<br><strong>权重会自动转换为几率值。计算方式为：(1/总权重)*权重。</strong><br>因此，默认配置文件意味着：<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>将石头转化为 76.92% 的下界岩。15.38% 的岩浆块和 7.7% 的石英矿石。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>将草方块转化为 100% 的下界岩。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>将泥土转化为 100% 的下界岩。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>将沙子转化为 100% 的灵魂沙。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>将砾石转化为 100% 的灵魂沙。</em></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>将石砖转化为 66.67% 的下界砖和 33.3% 的红下界砖。<br>将海晶灯转化为 100% 的萤石。<br>将耕地转化为 100% 的灵魂沙。<br>将小麦转化为 100% 的下界疣。</em></span><br>&nbsp;<br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Minecraft 1.16 及更高版本有不同的默认配置，使用新方块：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>stone; [netherrack&gt;10 + magma_block&gt;2 + nether_quartz_ore&gt;1],<br>grass; [nether_sprouts&gt;1],<br>cobblestone; [blackstone&gt;1],<br>grass_block; [crimson_nylium&gt;1],<br>dirt; [netherrack&gt;1],<br>coarse_dirt; [soul_soil&gt;1],<br>sand; [soul_sand&gt;1 + soul_soil&gt;1],<br>red_sand; [soul_soil&gt;1 + soul_sand&gt;1],<br>sandstone; [blackstone&gt;1],<br>cut_sandstone; [polished_blackstone&gt;1],<br>chiseled_sandstone; [chiseled_polished_blackstone&gt;1],<br>smooth_sandstone; [basalt&gt;1],<br>smooth_red_sandstone; [basalt&gt;1],<br>gravel; [soul_soil&gt;1],<br>stone_bricks; [nether_bricks&gt;2 + red_nether_bricks&gt;1],<br>sea_lantern; [glowstone&gt;1],<br>farmland; [soul_sand&gt;1],<br>wheat; [nether_wart&gt;1],<br>gold_ore; [nether_gold_ore&gt;1],<br>fern; [nether_sprouts&gt;1],<br>oak_leaves; [nether_wart_block&gt;1],<br>spruce_leaves; [nether_wart_block&gt;1],<br>birch_leaves; [warped_wart_block&gt;1],<br>jungle_leaves; [warped_wart_block&gt;1],<br>acacia_leaves; [nether_wart_block&gt;1],<br>dark_oak_leaves; [warped_wart_block&gt;1],<br>oak_log; [crimson_stem&gt;1],<br>spruce_log; [crimson_stem&gt;1],<br>birch_log; [warped_stem&gt;1],<br>jungle_log; [warped_stem&gt;1],<br>acacia_log; [crimson_stem&gt;1],<br>dark_oak_log; [warped_stem&gt;1],</p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg\" alt=\"描述\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>你还可以扩散其他模组的方块：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>例如来自 Mystical Agriculture 的灵魂石（Soulstone）：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"595\"></em></span></span><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"731\" height=\"152\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><em>对于模组方块，格式为 [<strong>MODID:Blockname</strong>&gt;weight]</em></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>（使用旧的扩散设置）</em></span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/f.png\" alt=\"1\" width=\"1440\" height=\"837\"></strong><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/g.png\" alt=\"2\" width=\"1440\" height=\"837\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/h.png\" alt=\"3\" width=\"1440\" height=\"837\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/i.png\" alt=\"4\" width=\"1440\" height=\"837\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/nether-portal-spread/j.png\" alt=\"5\" width=\"1440\" height=\"837\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注释和链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模組，前提是下載必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在眾多不同的模組頁面上追蹤評論，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
